"""Real Chromium DOM/MediaRecorder tests, mocked game transport and memory clip store.
Network requests are intercepted: a local origin serves the exact runtime converted to
offline ES modules. This does NOT certify IndexedDB disk persistence or native FiveM/GPU
capture. Run the live checklist before production deployment.
"""
